    "body": "## Is there a related GitHub Issue?\n#1949\n<!-- _If there is a corresponding GitHub Issue, please link it here._ -->\n\n## What is this change about?\n* Remove all references to servicebinding.io\n* Introduce `CFApp.Status.ServiceBindings` to reference all the mount\n  secrets from related service bindings\n* Introduce `AppWorkload.Spec.Services` that is populated with the\n  reference above ony when the workload is created. This is similar to\n  `BuildWorkload.Spec.Services`\n* By not setting `AppWorkload.Spec.Services` on every process\n  reconciliation loop, we avoid app pods getting restarted on every\n  `bind` operation\n* The statefulset runner takes care to project those secrets onto the\n  statefulset\n* Document all that in ADR `0019-service-credentials-projection.md`\n<!-- _Please describe the change here._ -->\n\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\nSort of, will be addressed by https://github.com/cloudfoundry/korifi/issues/3820\n<!-- _Please let us know if we should expect breaking changes in this PR._ -->\n\n\n",
